 "remarks": "Charming Cape Cod home in Wilton, a desirable Mid Fairfield County community. Located along a scenic country road, yet mere minutes from the village center, top ranked Schools and popular Wilton Y campus....Not to mention commute roads; and 5 mins from Cannondale Metro North train! 315 Olmstead Hill embodies classic New England architecture paired with unbeatable convenience. This comfortably-sized Cape, with significant, quality additional space in the partially Finished Walk-Out Lower Level, offers maximum flexibility for a wide range of lifestyles and life situations. The lush half-acre Lot possesses the perfect balance of lawn/perennial beds and Nature with its gorgeous views. There are Full Bathrooms on each Level. Some Key Features and Benefits: The Living Room with Dining Area is sun-lit, and anchored by a cozy stone Fireplace--ideal for crisp New England evenings. The home's Layout is Open and Inviting, including the main level Primary, with Walk-In Closet; 2 Bright Bedrooms upstairs; the Bonus Finished Lower Level; the Mud Room/Breezeway, separating the Oversized 2 Vehicle Attached Garage from the living quarters. Seamless flow from the timelessly Updated Kitchen with newer high-end Appliances, past the Breakfast Bar, to the Dining Area and Living Room. 315 Olmstead Hill is an outstanding opportunity to acquire a Move-In Home, or to customize a Classic Home in a convenient, highly desirable Location!!",
